WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:01,800
To be honest, I do still have feelings for you

2
00:00:01,800 --> 00:00:03,760
It’s just that I knew you hurt me too deeply

3
00:00:03,760 --> 00:00:04,920
Let me move to your house

4
00:00:04,920 --> 00:00:06,280
I will listen to you from now on

5
00:00:06,280 --> 00:00:07,560
Take me with you

6
00:00:07,560 --> 00:00:08,480
stay away from me

7
00:00:08,480 --> 00:00:10,160
I only accept you

8
00:00:10,160 --> 00:00:14,920
Let's draw a clear line with them.

9
00:00:14,920 --> 00:00:18,700
I don't want to suffer in this hellish place anymore

10
00:00:18,700 --> 00:00:25,480
We suffered heavy losses and wanted to run away, dreaming of Yuqin

11
00:00:25,480 --> 00:00:27,680
You clearly said at the beginning that the most beautiful thing was to serve Zhang Yi

12
00:00:27,680 --> 00:00:29,600
And promised to be with me

13
00:00:29,600 --> 00:00:32,040
Why should we abandon us now and go to him alone to support him?

14
00:00:33,060 --> 00:00:35,380
Is it wrong for me to want a better life?

15
00:00:35,380 --> 00:00:36,980
I'll follow you and make a fortune

16
00:00:36,980 --> 00:00:38,780
In the end, I can only starve and freeze.

17
00:00:38,780 --> 00:00:40,620
Zhang Yi’s family is warm and prosperous

18
00:00:40,620 --> 00:00:45,810
It was my choice for me to seek refuge with him Zhou Peng

19
00:00:45,810 --> 00:00:47,290
you are a good person

20
00:00:47,290 --> 00:00:49,610
But love shouldn’t tie me up to live a hard life

21
00:00:49,610 --> 00:00:51,290
You can't give me everything he can give me
